Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.81,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(416,95)}Transformation Cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.81,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs29\pos(386,601)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Go buy some snacks to treat our guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How troublesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Idea! Doraemon, it's shopping time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, is he out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Animal Cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.17,0:00:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the right thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.15,0:00:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to buy cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's OK, I love cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, go buy some decent snacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.43,0:01:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.34,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This and this, and that as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.65,0:01:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One... Two... Three... Four...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you staring at my face, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.46,0:01:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You ate that cookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:01:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's Animal Transformation Cookie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:02:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do now? Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's effects wear off after a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.86,0:02:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You will lose the cat face, 5 minutes from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.43,0:02:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You are right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave the cookies to our guest? You're inviting trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he ate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you eat the cookies, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel anything strange inside your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three....!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You had four?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude of you towards our guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.79,0:02:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, is there any way to prevent the cookies' effects?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, sadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have ate the Horse-shaped cookie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.51,0:03:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,MIster, please come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.69,0:03:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something very important to tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.66,0:03:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, where did you put the cookies that you bought?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.10,0:03:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I left them at the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.91,0:03:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder if it's your cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the the snack is very tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This time it's chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, go to the bathroom again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, there's a phone call for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.78,0:04:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It will ring now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.79,0:04:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, hello! But I'm just a nobody!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's chat, just for 1 hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I have no idea what you are talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know who played this prank on me, I am puzzled!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.91,0:04:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's not changing back yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.10,0:05:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't look, Mom, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, what the hell are you doing in front of our guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, wonder where they went?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.18,0:05:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,i will take my leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.05,0:05:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was unable to treat you to any decent snacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.79,0:05:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, please stay for a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one more cookie's effects that must be wore off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I am leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.13,0:05:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a frog face!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom must be angry at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so shivering, I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I am home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you two did something, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I will apologize to your mom on the behalf of you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I am home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.23,0:06:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Mom ate one too!
